    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="namespacetle92466ed_1_1GLOBAL__CONFIG" kindref="compound">GLOBAL_CONFIG</ref> register bit definitions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Global configuration register (write only in Config Mode).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Bit Map:</title><para><verbatim>* Bit 14  : VIO_SEL        - VIO voltage selection (0=3.3V, 1=5.0V)
* Bit 13  : UV_OV_SWAP     - UV/OV swap test
* Bit 12  : OT_TEST        - Over-temperature test
* Bit 5   : V1V5_OV_TEST   - 1.5V overvoltage test
* Bit 4   : V1V5_UV_TEST   - 1.5V undervoltage test
* Bit 2   : CRC_EN         - CRC check enable
* Bit 1   : SPI_WD_EN      - SPI watchdog enable
* Bit 0   : CLK_WD_EN      - Clock watchdog enable
* </verbatim></para>
</simplesect>
Default: 0x4005 </para>
    </detaileddescription>
